i) Barangay Clearance(s);
j) List of proposed operating locations and time the mobile food vendor will be operating;
k) Valid Identification of the owner or operator, or in case of a partnership or corporation, the Valid IDs of the senior or managing partners and that of the President or Corporate Secretary;
