**SECTION 9. THE OPERATIONS DIVISION OF THE CITY WATER RESOURCES OFFICE - The Operations Division of the City Water Resources Office (CVRO) shall be composed of specialists, engineers, technicians, assistants, community extension workers and other related field personnel. All data and activities shall be reviewed by the Science, Technology and Laboratory Division, and shall be recorded at the Information and Management Division. The division shall include, but not limited to, the following sections and the respective functions:**

