(b) A fine of Five Thousand Pesos (P5,000.00) and imprisonment of not more than one (1) year in case of tampering or providing a tampered copy of CCTV footage that will result in falsification of CCTV footage or obstruction of justice, or failure to observe person's right to privacy, without prejudice to the provisions of Section 13.1 of this Ordinance.

(c) A fine of Three Thousand Pesos (P3,000.00) in all other cases under this Ordinance and for each commission of the same offenses thereafter.

In case of a single proprietorship, the owner shall be made liable for the violation of this Ordinance.

