**SECTION 9. STI, HIV AND AIDS EDUCATION IN THE WORKPLACE**

- The DCAC, through the CHO-HPU, in coordination with the relevant City Departments or Offices and the Department of Labor and Employment (DOLE) and the Civil Service Commission (CSC), shall provide standard basic Information and Instruction on STI, HIV and AIDS, national and local HIV related laws and other related issues of stigma reduction and discrimination in the workplace, public and private, including the Armed Forces of the Philippines (AFP) and the Philippine National Police (PNP).

