The Mobile Food Vendors Committee shall meet as required. A special meeting may be called by any of the committee members. The Committee is empowered to promulgate the necessary rules and regulations for the implementation of this Ordinance. Furthermore, additional conditions and guidelines may be imposed by the Committee with the general goal of ensuring the safety and health of mobile food vendors in the City. It shall also be the responsibility of the Committee to coordinate with the appropriate national agencies to ensure the seamless and orderly operation of mobile food vendors in the City.

