SERVICES, PRIVILEGES, AND BENEFITS FOR SOLO PARENTS
AND THEIR CHILDREN, APPROPRIATING FUNDS THEREOF AND
FOR OTHER PURPOSES PURSUANT TO REPUBLIC ACT NO. 8972,
AS AMENDED BY REPUBLIC ACT NO. 11861, KNOWN AS THE
