14. That the LESSOR or his authorized representative shall have the right at all times to enter the space to inspect, examine, make alterations, disconnect electric supply, or for any purposes which is deem necessary for the operation, maintenance, and management of the night and weekend street market;

15. That during the effectivity of this contract or while the LESSEE is in the legal or physical possession of the space, the LESSOR shall not be liable for any injuries, damage, caused to or suffered by the former, his employees, or customers;

16. That violation of any of the foregoing terms and conditions and other applicable laws, rules, and regulations shall be full payment of fees due. The LESSOR shall have the right to extra-judicially eject the LESSEE from the space without any liability whatsoever on the part of the LESSOR;

