SECTION IN THE NIGHT AND WEEKEND STREET MARKET**

**SECTION 1.** For the purpose of order and aesthetics, the Night Market and Weekend Street Market shall be arranged in section as follows:

a) Dry Goods

    a.1 Clothing and Clothing Apparel;
    a.2 Personal accessories;
    a.3 Footwears;
    a.4 Kitchenwares;
    a.5 Groceries;
    a.6 Textiles;
    a.7 Gift Section Items;

