    b.1 Turo-turo Food;
    b.2 Barbecue Stands;
    b.3 Softdrinks;
    b.4 Food Stalls;
    b.5 Balos;
    b.6 Breads, Biscuits and Homemade Food Products;
    b.7 Corn, and other vended agricultural produced except livestock, etc.;
    b.8 Fruit;

c) Services

    c.1 Shoe Shine;
    c.2 Massage;
    c.3 Beauty Salon;

d) Plant and Flowers;

e) Cereal Sections;

**ARTICLE 17
WEARING OF IDENTIFICATION CARD AND COLOR CODED T-SHIRTS**

**SECTION 1.** Owners/Occupants, salesboys or salesgirls, helpers and other personnel hired by the occupants must wear, at all times, an identification card duly issued by the City Government with the Health Card ID issued by the City Health Office (CHO).

**SECTION 2.** Owners/Occupants, salesboys or salesgirls, helpers and other personnel hired by the occupants must wear a colored T-shirt as per category of items sold as follows:

    a) Dry Goods - Blue;
