AN ORDINANCE FURTHER AMENDING CITY ORDINANCE NO. 0361-10, SERIES OF 2010, OTHERWISE KNOWN AS THE "DAVAO CITY ECOLOGICAL SOLID WASTE MANAGEMENT ORDINANCE"

