Ord. No. 0987-22

transportation, transfer, processing, treatment, or disposal of solid waste such as Sanitary Landfill, Waste-to-Energy, Materials Recovery Facility (MRF), Composting and Hazardous Waste Containment Facility of the City;

v) Source Reduction shall refer to the reduction of solid waste before it enters the solid waste stream by methods such as product design, materials substitution, materials re-use and packaging restrictions;

