5.1 Declaration of Barangay Blood Donors' Month: The Barangay Blood Donors' Month is hereby declared in all barangays of the city every month of July, in conjunction with the celebration of the National Blood Donors' Month, pursuant to Presidential Proclamation No. 1021 and the Implementing Rules and Regulations of the National Blood Services Act of 1994 (Republic Act 7719, Section 13, Item No. 2);

5.2 Public Education: This is an organized barangay-wide public education campaign by the barangay, in coordination with the partner agencies, to raise the awareness of the barangay residents on the value, importance, advantages, and benefits of voluntary blood donation;

